{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bd296c75-6a36-8576-805f-f11c5d4e2d49",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:00:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anthony Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:57:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:57:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good morning. Pardon me, can you hear me okay? I'm on my cell and the signal's not great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:58:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. I'm calling about water pooling at the curb, a drainage problem. It's at 230 Coggeshall Avenue, up in the Historic Hill area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:58:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "230 Coggeshall Avenue. Okay. And what's it doing, is it backing up out of a drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:58:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pardon me? [line breaks up] ...say that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:58:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said, is the water coming up out of a storm drain, or just collecting along the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:58:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's collecting at the curb. It's the meltwater, from the snow piles melting in the afternoon. There's no storm right now, it's been dry. But it just sits there, and it's deep. It comes up to about the hubcaps on my car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:58:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps. Wow, okay. So that's a good amount of standing water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, ma'am. And then at night it freezes over. By the morning it's black ice all across the edge of the road and the sidewalk. Somebody's going to slip on it, I'm worried a person's going to get hurt, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:59:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's a real hazard. Is it the same spot every day, right in front of 230?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:59:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, [inaudible] right in front, by the curb. Pardon me, I missed that. Could you repeat it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I asked if it's the same spot every day, right in front of the building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:59:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, same spot. Every afternoon it builds up again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:59:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me read this back so I have it right. 230 Coggeshall Avenue, meltwater ponding at the curb, about hubcap deep, freezing overnight into ice. No storm, just a drainage problem. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:59:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, yes. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:59:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a work order for a crew to look at the drain and the curb line. Do you want a call back when it's scheduled?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:59:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please. It's 401-555-0150."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:59:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0150. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:00:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pardon me, one more question. Do the crews work on weekends? Because the ice is the worst on Saturday and Sunday mornings, when people are out walking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:00:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They can get called out on weekends for hazards like ice, yes. I'll note on the order that it's a slipping hazard so it gets looked at sooner rather than later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:00:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'd appreciate that. Oh, and, sorry, my wipers have been squeaking so loud this morning, you might hear it, I'm in the car right now. [crosstalk]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:00:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did hear something in the background, I wondered. Are you driving?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:00:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I'm parked. Just ran the wipers to clear the windshield. Sorry about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:00:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. So you'll hear from us at that number once the crew is scheduled. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:00:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's everything. Thank you very much, ma'am."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:00:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon, Mr. Mancini."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:00:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
